  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-file-info-0000001111685202#section41694086",
      "text": "图片、视频、APK、RPK、AAB等文件上传完成后，通过该接口刷新应用文件信息。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-file-info-0000001111685202#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式和OAuth客户端方式的区别请参见使用入门。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-file-info-0000001111685202#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-file-info-0000001111685202#section236517415165",
      "text": "OAuth客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-file-info-0000001111685202#section1131102811712",
      "text": "请求Body中使用JSON格式携带更新的应用文件信息，参数如下表所示。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-file-info-0000001111685202#section1131102811712",
      "text": "FileInfo"
