      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-app-file-info-0000001111685202#section1131102811712",
      "text": "调用更新应用文件信息接口，需确保发布国家字段不能为空，具体参见publishCountry字段。"
